RAG Architecture with AI Models

Documents (e.g. policy.txt, annuity.txt)
   ↓
Embedding (nomic-embed-text)
   ↓
Vector store (memory)
   ↓
User question
   ↓
Embedding
   ↓
Cosine similarity search
   ↓
Top documents (Relevant Context)
   ↓
Llama3 LLM (I am taking ollama's free LLM model-llama3)
   ↓
Answer



